# Deliverables must survive a round trip byte for byte.
#
# The OBJ and MTL are text, and without this Git would CRLF-convert them on a
# Windows checkout: the file a collaborator gets would not be the file the
# writer produced, its size would grow, and every diff would be whole-file.
# They are written LF by `ayama.mesh.obj` and stay LF everywhere.
*.obj text eol=lf
*.mtl text eol=lf

# Raster and image payloads: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
